      "title": "B\u00f3kun REST Key Pair",
      "type": "object",
      "x-credential-instructions": "Existing REST API access-key and secret-key pair documented by B\u00f3kun's current publisher schema. These keys are distinct from App Store GraphQL access tokens. Match sandbox/production; actual vendor permissions and API entitlement must be verified. No key creation or secret retrieval is performed.",
      "x-credential-url": "https://bokun.dev/"
